--   Istmina  (rel 1309472): https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org/search?q=Istmina,+Choc%C3%B3,+Colombia&format=jsonv2&polygon_geojson=1
--   Condoto  (rel 1309483): https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org/search?q=Condoto,+Choc%C3%B3,+Colombia&format=jsonv2&polygon_geojson=1
